--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
PARITY (web AINLGrafanaPanel.tsx -> native)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Hooks       : useTranslation -> P1/S10 NLGrafanaPanelStrings ; useAiStream ->
              NLGrafanaPanelModel/Source (POST /ai/power/grafana-panel/draft, body { prompt }).
Composition : withAiFeature('nl-grafana-panel') gate -> renderState .gatedOff EmptyView ;
              AIFeatureCard (title + cyan Helix badge + description + inputSlot Textarea +
              universal "Ask Helix") ; {draft && …} -> NLGrafanaPanelDraftCard + "Apply to editor" ;
              AiOutputPanel (thinking / rationale / Helix error).
Draft DTO   : GrafanaPanelDraft{ prompt, panel{ title, type, datasource{type,uid},
              targets[]{ref_id, raw_sql?, expr?, format?}, grid_pos{x,y,w,h} }, rationale,
              referenced_tables[] }. parse() mirrors web guard chain bit-for-bit; datasource and
              grid_pos are REQUIRED (absent/malformed collapses whole draft to nil), targets and
              referenced_tables default to []. Propose-only (ADR-015 §I8): apply() forwards via
              onApply; the view never writes editor state.
States      : gateLoading / ready-idle / streaming / rationale / draft / stream-error / gateError /
              stale / offline / gatedOff — every one renders (no hidden surface) except the
              sanctioned AI-Off "render nothing".
i18n        : every t() key from source present (powerGrafana.aiDrafter.title/description/button/
              badge/promptPlaceholder/promptLabel/applyButton/applyTooltip) + Helix scaffold keys;
              no English literals in Swift (all via NLGrafanaPanelStrings facade).
a11y        : VoiceOver labels on every interactive element (prompt field, action, apply, refresh,
              badge, target rows, meta chips) ; Dynamic Type (no fixed text frames) ; reduce-motion
              gate on the sparkles pulse ; testable summary seam.
telemetry   : view.opened emits slug "AINLGrafanaPanel" (P1/S11) on first start().

